    "source": "Before the game begins, each player picks a hero and readies up; the line above the buttons always says what comes next. Whoever steers the story (the party lead, or the GM when a person runs the table) can change the table settings, in the same named groups the campaign creator used: world and story, character creation, narration, atmosphere, safety, and the rest. Each group says what is set inside before you open it, and every change applies to everyone at once. Share the room code or copy the invite link to bring in more players; the owner or the GM opens the table once everyone is ready.",
